title: a pytestmark in conftest.py is reported at info, since pytest never reads it there
origin: #209 B3 and ruling 209.Q3: pytest does not collect conftest.py as a test
origin2: module, so the line disables nothing (2 passed on pytest 9.1.1); it blocked at high.
